   "he": "מַתְנִי׳ מָצָא גִּיטֵּי נָשִׁים וְשִׁחְרוּרֵי עֲבָדִים, דְּיָיתֵיקֵי, מַתָּנָה, וְשׁוֹבָרִין – הֲרֵי זֶה לֹא יַחֲזִיר. שֶׁאֲנִי אוֹמֵר: כְּתוּבִין הָיוּ, וְנִמְלַךְ עֲלֵיהֶן שֶׁלֹּא לִתְּנָן.",
   "en": "«MISHNA:» If «one found bills of divorce, or» bills of «manumission of slaves,» or «wills,» or deeds of «a gift, or receipts, he may not return» these items to the one who is presumed to have lost them, «as I say» it is possible that «they were written and» then the writer «reconsidered about them» and decided «not to deliver them.»"
  }
 ],
